  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <JapaneseText>デュナミス孤児院</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunamis Orphanage</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>デュナミス孤児院</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunamis Orphanage</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>メェェ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meh...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>コケェーッ　コッコ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Cock-a-doodle-doo!</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>久しぶりに来てみたが････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I haven't been here
in forever, but...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････相変わらず、ボロっちいな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I see that things are
as run-down as ever.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>相変わらずじゃないよ、&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not everything's the same
as when you left, Loni.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>雨もりする場所が三ヶ所増えたし
この前は、床板が抜けたし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've got leaks in three more places
and recently, the floorboards gave way.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････あ～あ
あのウワサが本当ならなぁ
ここも、チョチョイと直せるのによ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Aw man, what I wouldn't give for
that rumor to be true. We could fix
this place up in a jiffy if it were.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あのウワサ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That rumor?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>この近くに、ラグナ遺跡ってあるだろ？
あそこの最上部で
でっかいレンズが発見されたんだと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's a place called the Laguna Ruins around
here, right? They say that a humongous Lens was
discovered on the top floor.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>神団の方にも情報が入ってて
調査隊が、もうダリルシェイドまで来てる
俺は、その護衛役なんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Church of Atamoni got ahold of this
information too and an investigation team's
already on its way to Darilsheid.
{02}I'm acting as their escort.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>でもさ、それと孤児院と
なんの関係があるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, but what does that
have to do with the orphanage?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>へへ････聞いて驚け
そのレンズの価値は････
三百万ガルドを、軽く上まわるんだと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh heh...you'll be shocked when you
hear this. Word has it that the Lens
is worth...slightly over 3,000,000 Gald.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>さ、三百万ガルド!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>T, three million Gald!?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく、それさえあれば
この孤児院も建てなおせる
ルーティさんも、ラクできるってワケだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In any case, we could rebuild this
orphanage if we only had that Lens.
{02}That means that Rutee
could live the easy life too.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>よし、行こう、&lt;Loni&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, let's go, &lt;Loni&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>行くって････
おい、まさか
遺跡に行くつもりじゃないだろうな!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By &quot;go,&quot; you don't mean...
Hey, you're not planning on
going to the ruins, are you!?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yup!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あのなぁ････
これは、あくまでウワサなんだよ
ウ・ワ・サ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now listen here...
keep in mind that
this is just a rumor.
{02}A r-u-m-o-r!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>それに、万が一本当だったとしても
そいつを奪えば、アタモニ神団に
目をつけられるんだぞ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And besides, even on the
off-chance that it's true...
{02}...the Church of Atamoni won't let you out
of its sight if you swipe that thing, you know!?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>でも、&lt;Loni&gt;は探そうと思ってるんでしょ？
だから、護衛役を引き受けたんだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But &lt;Loni&gt;, you were thinking about
searching for it, weren't you?
{02}That's why you took on the job
as their escort, am I right?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ack!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <JapaneseText>でもって、&lt;Loni&gt;のことだから････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But this is you we're
talking about here, so...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <JapaneseText>「&lt;Kyle&gt;やルーティさんに
  メイワクはかけられない」</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&quot;I can't cause any trouble
for &lt;Kyle&gt; and Rutee.&quot;</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････とかいって
ひとりで探すつもりだったんでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You thought something along those
lines and had every intention to go
looking for it by yourself, right?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ううっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Double ack!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <JapaneseText>それこそ水くさいよ！
&lt;Loni&gt;と、オレの仲じゃないか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now who's being the stranger!
We're buddies, aren't we &lt;Loni&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････やれやれ
口は災いの元ってのはホントだな････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Good grief. They weren't kidding
when they said that the mouth is the
root of misfortune, were they...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <JapaneseText>分かったよ、&lt;Kyle&gt;
連れてってやるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I hear ya, &lt;Kyle&gt;.
I'll take you with me.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <JapaneseText>そうこなくっちゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now that's more like it!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ただし！ルーティさんの許可が出たらだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But! Only after we get Rutee's permission.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <JapaneseText>分かってるって！
じゃ、さっそく母さんに話さなくっちゃ
行こう、&lt;Loni&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I gotcha already!
Then I have to talk to mom
right away. Let's go, &lt;Loni&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;と&lt;Loni&gt;は
称号「&lt;item:00000807&gt;」を得ました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt; and &lt;Loni&gt; acquired the title
&quot;&lt;item:00000807&gt;&quot;.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <JapaneseText>？？？？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>?????</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <JapaneseText>スタンにルーティだな
先の災厄を救った、四英雄の････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Stahn and Rutee, I presume?
Two of the four heroes who saved the
world from that cataclysm some time ago...</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <JapaneseText>目的はなんだ？
金か、レンズか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What're you after!?
Is it money? Lens?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <JapaneseText>？？？？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>?????</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <JapaneseText>貴様らの、命だ････！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Your wretched lives...!</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;、&lt;Loni&gt;！
ふたりとも、逃げてぇっ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;, &lt;Loni&gt;!
You two get out of here!!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;････？
&lt;Kyle&gt;なのね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;....?
Hey, &lt;Kyle&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････おねえちゃん、だれ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....oh, who's sister?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <JapaneseText>そうか････
記憶を封印してしまったのね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really....
You've sealed your memory.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <JapaneseText>イヤなことを忘れて
幸せな夢の世界で
生き続ける････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You forgotten what you don't like
and live in a dream world.
Just to survive....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ、なんのこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>キオク？　フウイン？
Hey, what's wrong?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <JapaneseText>これはたしかに
幸せかもしれない
でも････！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, this might seem
like everything is perfect, 
but....!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お願い、&lt;Kyle&gt;
目を覚まして！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please, &lt;Kyle&gt;
wake up!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お、おねえちゃん
痛いよ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ow, hey sis
that hurts....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <JapaneseText>これが、あなたの望んだ世界なの!?
これが幸せなの!?
違うよね、&lt;Kyle&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, is this the world you want!?
Are you really happy!?
You're not, &lt;Kyle&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <JapaneseText>思いだして！　みんなのこと！
わたしたちの旅のこと！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Remember!  About everyone!
About our journey!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おもい････だす？
旅････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>About our.... journey?
I....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ううっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <JapaneseText>痛い！
頭が痛いよ、おねえちゃん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hurts!
My head hurts, Sis!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <JapaneseText>つらいのはわかってる
思いだしたくないのも、わかってる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know it's hard.
I know you don't want to remember!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <JapaneseText>でも････あなたしかいないの！
わたしが頼れるのは････
わたしの英雄は、あなただけなの！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But... You are the only one!
The only one I can rely on....
You are my only hero!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <JapaneseText>だから････
お願い&lt;Kyle&gt;
目を覚まして！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So....
Please, &lt;Kyle&gt;.
Wake up!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <JapaneseText>えい････ゆう････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He....ro....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････そうだ、オレは････！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....Yes, I....!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>59</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････これは････
夢、なんだね････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....This is....
It's, just a dream....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>61</Id>
      <JapaneseText>すごく、あったかくて
心地よくて、でも････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <JapaneseText>これはすべて････夢なんだ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's warm....and pleasant but....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>63</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Loni&gt;････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････&lt;Kyle&gt;
やっぱり、あれは夢だったんだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....&lt;Kyle&gt;
After all, it was only a dream.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うん････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いい夢だったよなぁ
スタンさんがいて、ルーティさんがいて
俺がいて、おまえがいる････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was a good dream.
Stahn and Rutee were there.
I was there, and you too....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>67</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Loni&gt;････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <JapaneseText>けど、夢は夢だ
そんなものに、なんの意味もねえ
俺たちは、今を生きてるんだからよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, dreams are dreams.
There's no meaning in them, and even though
it's hard, we have to live in the Present.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
